---
import MainLayout from "../Layouts/main.layout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="404 - Página no encontrada">
	<main class="container-404">
		<div class="number-404">404</div>
		<h1>Esta página no existe</h1>
		<p>Lo sentimos, la página que estás buscando no existe o ha sido movida.</p>
		<a href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
	</main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
	.container-404 {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 80vh;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2rem;
	}

	.number-404 {
		font-size: 8rem;
		font-weight: bold;
		color: #666;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		line-height: 1;
		animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes float {
		0%, 100% {
			transform: translateY(0px);
			opacity: 0.8;
		}
		50% {
			transform: translateY(-10px);
			opacity: 1;
		}
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		color: #333;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	p {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #666;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		max-width: 500px;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	a {
		background-color: #333;
		color: white;
		padding: 12px 24px;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
		display: inline-block;
	}

	a:hover {
		background-color: #555;
	}
</style>